      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001688757-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001688757-26-000022-ae6ab6edea64910f",
        "accession_number": "0001688757-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our products are commercially available in over 100 countries through exclusive distributors, except in the United States, Brazil, Argentina and several European countries where we sell through our direct sales force.",
        "start_character": 35299,
        "end_character": 35516
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001688757-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001688757-26-000022-ae6ab6edea64910f",
        "accession_number": "0001688757-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Successful claims of infringement by a third party could prevent us from selling or distributing certain products or performing certain services, require us to expend time and resources to develop non-infringing products, or force us to pay substantial damages, including treble damages if we are found to have willfully infringed patents-royalties or other fees.",
        "start_character": 40189,
        "end_character": 40552
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001688757-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001688757-26-000022-ae6ab6edea64910f",
        "accession_number": "0001688757-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The marketability of any products for which we receive market authorization for commercial sale may suffer if the government and third-party payors fail to provide adequate coverage and reimbursement.",
        "start_character": 85180,
        "end_character": 85380
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001688757-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001688757-26-000022-ae6ab6edea64910f",
        "accession_number": "0001688757-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We manufacture our products in ISO-13485-certified manufacturing facilities located in the Coyol Free Zone office park in Alajuela, Costa Rica, a park populated by a number of international medical device companies and granted tax-advantaged status by the government of Costa Rica.",
        "start_character": 43565,
        "end_character": 43846
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001688757-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001688757-26-000022-ae6ab6edea64910f",
        "accession_number": "0001688757-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "A surgical technique that we have developed, which we call Minimally Invasive Aesthetics, or Mia Femtech, utilizes our next-generation Ergonomix2 Diamond implant to take advantage of these physical properties to enable a less-invasive procedure for the patient.",
        "start_character": 21250,
        "end_character": 21511
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001688757-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001688757-26-000022-ae6ab6edea64910f",
        "accession_number": "0001688757-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a manufacturer, we are subject to periodic inspections by the FDA.",
        "start_character": 70628,
        "end_character": 70697
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001688757-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001688757-26-000022-ae6ab6edea64910f",
        "accession_number": "0001688757-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Beginning in October 2024 we submitted a PMA Supplement for our Post Approval Study protocol, and we began selling Motiva Implants for use in breast augmentation for patients in the United States.",
        "start_character": 63409,
        "end_character": 63605
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001688757-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001688757-26-000022-ae6ab6edea64910f",
        "accession_number": "0001688757-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In April 2023, we launched Mia Femtech — a patient-centric procedure designed to allow breast augmentation to be performed under local anesthesia rather than general anesthesia, through smaller incisions, with faster recovery times and a resulting reduction in surgical complications.",
        "start_character": 27797,
        "end_character": 28081
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001688757-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001688757-26-000022-ae6ab6edea64910f",
        "accession_number": "0001688757-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In August 2019, we announced that we were implementing a bifurcated regulatory strategy in the United States, which is designed to allow us to initiate the rolling submission of data to the FDA from the primary augmentation and revision augmentation cohorts, and then subsequently supplement our PMA with data from the reconstruction cohorts.",
        "start_character": 29875,
        "end_character": 30217
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001688757-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001688757-26-000022-ae6ab6edea64910f",
        "accession_number": "0001688757-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In February 2025, we introduced Preservé in targeted markets, a minimally invasive breast tissue-preserving technology designed for breast augmentation, revision augmentation, and mastopexy augmentation.",
        "start_character": 26716,
        "end_character": 26919
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001688757-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001688757-26-000022-ae6ab6edea64910f",
        "accession_number": "0001688757-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In June 2024, we finalized the construction of our Sulàyöm Innovation Campus including 100,000 square feet of manufacturing, medical, research, and office space allowing us to increase our manufacturing capacity by approximately 730,000 units per year.",
